    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side-Scrolling Platformer Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an exhilarating Metroidvania-style adventure that seamlessly blends classic platforming dynamics with the thrilling intensity of twin-stick shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/09968bda10b223e6425d56ef58607ee9.poster.avif?t=1745846362\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/09968bda10b223e6425d56ef58607ee9.webm?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/09968bda10b223e6425d56ef58607ee9.mp4?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse arsenal of guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a diverse arsenal of guns, offering unique ways to conquer challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/9da73b242ccbe4d850869c4d296ac3bd.poster.avif?t=1745846362\" width=740 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/9da73b242ccbe4d850869c4d296ac3bd.webm?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/9da73b242ccbe4d850869c4d296ac3bd.mp4?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Helpful Pick-Ups and Portals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find strategic items along the way to aid with progression. Use the portals to save pickups and backtrack to pickup  items that were left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.poster.avif?t=1745846362\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.webm?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.mp4?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become stronger by finding new heart containers. Upgrade shield , dash and bullet booster specifications to make them last longer and reduce cooldown time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to welcome players of all skill levels. Blast Hopper avoids the steep learning curve, making it perfect for both casual play and thrilling adventure. Embrace the fun and excitement as you jump, shoot, and dash your way through a world rich with discovery and action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side-Scrolling Platformer Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an exhilarating Metroidvania-style adventure that seamlessly blends classic platforming dynamics with the thrilling intensity of twin-stick shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/09968bda10b223e6425d56ef58607ee9.poster.avif?t=1745846362\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/09968bda10b223e6425d56ef58607ee9.webm?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/09968bda10b223e6425d56ef58607ee9.mp4?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse arsenal of guns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a diverse arsenal of guns, offering unique ways to conquer challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/9da73b242ccbe4d850869c4d296ac3bd.poster.avif?t=1745846362\" width=740 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/9da73b242ccbe4d850869c4d296ac3bd.webm?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/9da73b242ccbe4d850869c4d296ac3bd.mp4?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Helpful Pick-Ups and Portals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find strategic items along the way to aid with progression. Use the portals to save pickups and backtrack to pickup  items that were left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.poster.avif?t=1745846362\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.webm?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737680/extras/5b78c3ceefdd294b48f7b42452e8091b.mp4?t=1745846362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become stronger by finding new heart containers. Upgrade shield , dash and bullet booster specifications to make them last longer and reduce cooldown time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to welcome players of all skill levels. Blast Hopper avoids the steep learning curve, making it perfect for both casual play and thrilling adventure. Embrace the fun and excitement as you jump, shoot, and dash your way through a world rich with discovery and action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
